# --- Retail CEO Office (HF Docker Space) ---
# Ignore installed node deps + TS build cache, but KEEP the frontend source
# and the prebuilt production bundle (office/frontend/dist) so the Space can
# serve the SPA without a Node build stage.
office/frontend/node_modules/
office/frontend/*.tsbuildinfo
!office/frontend/dist/
!office/frontend/**/*.json
